WEBVTT

00:13:29.912 --> 00:13:32.787
because they have to keep proving their
strength over and over again?

00:13:33.579 --> 00:13:34.954
This is super interesting.

00:13:34.954 --> 00:13:38.371
And this is I'm like, this is me thinking
out loud with you just spit balling

00:13:38.371 --> 00:13:45.246
right now. Why is vulnerability? So much.

00:13:46.912 --> 00:13:54.329
More difficult to talk about
with men in suits.

00:13:55.371 --> 00:13:59.287
In organizations or hoodies and jeans,
because I work in Silicon Valley a lot,

00:13:59.287 --> 00:14:05.662
right. Why is it more difficult to talk
about with them than it is with.